{"unit":2,"items":21,"pass":15,"title":"Unit Test · Unit 2","html":"\n  <section class=\"stage on\" data-stage=\"Unit Test\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Unit 2 &middot; Unit Test</div>\n      <h2>People and days</h2>\n      <p>Twenty-one questions on Lessons 5&ndash;8: nationalities, family, routines, time. Answer them all, then press Check. You need <b>15 out of 21</b> to pass &mdash; and you can take this test as many times as you like.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"review-u2\">\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">Part 1 &middot; Grammar and vocabulary &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 1&ndash;15</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\">Choose the correct answer.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">He is from Brazil — he is ___.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Brazilish</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Brazilian</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Brazilese</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">She is from Poland — she is ___.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Polish</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Polish́</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Polandish</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">My friend ___ three languages.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">speak</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">speaking</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">speaks</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">This is my ___ phone. (sister)\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">sister</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">sisters</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">sister's</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"body\">My mother's father is my ___.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">uncle</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">nephew</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">grandfather</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"body\">She ___ up at seven every day.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">getting</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">gets</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">get</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">7</span><span class=\"body\">He ___ TV in the evening.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">watches</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">watch</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">watchs</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">8</span><span class=\"body\">My brother ___ breakfast at eight.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">has</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">have</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">haves</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">9</span><span class=\"body\">She ___ eat meat.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">doesn't</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">isn't</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">don't</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">10</span><span class=\"body\">I ___ like Mondays.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">doesn't</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">don't</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">am not</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">11</span><span class=\"body\">We meet ___ six o'clock.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">on</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">at</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">in</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">12</span><span class=\"body\">7:30 = ___ past seven\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">half</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">quarter</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">thirty</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">13</span><span class=\"body\">I work ___ home on Fridays.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">in</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">on</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">at</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">14</span><span class=\"body\">How often do you cook? — I ___ ever cook.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">always</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">hardly</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">hard</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">15</span><span class=\"body\">They ___ in a flat in Almaty. (live)\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">lives</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">living</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">live</button></div></span></div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\" style=\"margin-top:26px\">Part 2 &middot; Write the answer &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 16&ndash;21</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\">Type your answer. Spelling counts; capital letters and full stops do not.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">16</span><span class=\"body\">Country → nationality: He is from Germany.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"He is German.\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">17</span><span class=\"body\">Rewrite with 's: the room of my brother<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"my brother's room\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">18</span><span class=\"body\">Change to SHE: I get up early.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"She gets up early.\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">19</span><span class=\"body\">Make it negative: She likes tea.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"She doesn't like tea.\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">20</span><span class=\"body\">Fix the mistake: He speak French.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"He speaks French.\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">21</span><span class=\"body\">Write 7:30 in words.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"half past seven|seven thirty\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n\n      <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"checkReview(this)\" style=\"margin-top:24px\">Check my answers</button>\n      <div class=\"res\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div id=\"reviewResult\" class=\"review-result\"></div>\n  </section>\n"}